The table lists the **67 articles in JCR journals** published by team members since 2023 in the research areas of the project. Articles are marked according to the topics and transfer areas of the project: <span class="sym sym-ineq">⚖</span> inequality and poverty, <span class="sym sym-water">💧</span> water, <span class="sym sym-tour">✈</span> tourism and <span class="sym sym-firm">🏭</span> firms; an article can carry more than one mark (for example, a tourism article that also analyses inequality). Click on a title to open the article (Google Scholar). Quality indicators: JCR quartile of the journal **in the year of publication** and, where applicable, rating in the Chartered ABS *Academic Journal Guide* (AJG).

::: {.stats}
<span class='stat'><b>67</b> JCR articles</span> <span class='stat'><b>47</b> in Q1</span> <span class='stat'><b>58</b> in Q1–Q2</span> <span class='stat'><b>23</b> in ABS 3/4/4*</span> <span class='stat'><b>10</b> in ABS 4/4*</span>
:::

